entation-only. Refusals: Reject a lock missing any named document or gate, stale source evidence, or an attempt to turn that documentation decision into executable compiler, milestone or release acceptance. Evidence: retain the exact source/compiler/profile/target and applicable provider/checker identities, actual positive products and negative diagnostics for this criterion. Foundation requirement gravity/foundation-semantic-change-control: For a changed foundation guarantee publish the affected D0-D9 and downstream contract set, compatibility decision, changed conformance fixtures and evidence invalidations before claiming the changed support. Refusals: Reject a semantic change without affected-contract review, stale acceptance reuse or omitted compatibility/fixture updates; the policy record is not actual approval of the change. Evidence: retain the exact source/compiler/profile/target and applicable provider/checker identities, actual positive products and negative diagnostics for this criterion. Consume these actual dependency artifacts (not whole-component completion): tools/finite-service-outcomes-and-remaining-work/lint-analysis-tool-maintainer - Canonical D3 vocabulary/layer maps and source/manifest terminology check results; pass-evidence - Actual subject-bound checker/proof/certificate/audit/replay/test evidence and verdicts. Foundation requirement gravity/migration-provenance-safety: For a generated/migrated replacement slice preserve incumbent/source/generator provenance, recheck generated code and unsafe audit boundaries, and record the scoped conformance and performance evidence needed before retiring its interop path. Refusals: Reject interop retirement on translation success alone, missing provenance/audits or unexplained behavioral/performance differences; preserve policy-qualified narrowed and unsupported cases. Evidence: retain the exact source/compiler/profile/target and applicable provider/checker identities, actual positive products and negati