red evidence: HDL, testbench, interface/timing/source maps and simulation trace; bind source/compiler/profile/target/provider identities, source-mapped stable diagnostics and every applicable source facet field/exception/negative condition listed for this criterion in [the full preserved Domain context](plan.md#platform-source-context). Dependencies consume backend-hdl, legality/remaining-tasks-and-evidence/complete-profile-restrictions-and-generated-form-checks outputs under their stated contracts; no whole-component completion prerequisite. Status: Open; implementation acceptance unassessed. Criterion `domain/hardware-hdl-emission`: Emit traceable HDL, interface/clock/reset/timing records and executable simulation/testbench artifacts for accepted hardware IR. Accepted fixture: Emit HDL and source maps from accepted hardware IR together with interface, clock/reset/timing and simulation/testbench artifacts. Negative fixture: Reject an artifact missing source maps, typed vendor-IP boundary, timing constraints or simulation/equivalence evidence. Required evidence: traceable HDL artifact pack and conformance report; bind source/compiler/profile/target/provider identities, source-mapped stable diagnostics and every applicable source facet field/exception/negative condition listed for this criterion in [the full preserved Domain context](plan.md#platform-source-context). Dependencies consume backend-hdl, legality/remaining-tasks-and-evidence/complete-profile-restrictions-and-generated-form-checks outputs under their stated contracts; no whole-component completion prerequisite. Status: Open; implementation acceptance unassessed. Criterion `domain/hardware-shape-lowering`: Lower typed fixed-shape hardware values/control to finite hardware/domain IR, rejecting implicit widths/truncation and nonfinite runtime-only operations. Accepted fixture: Lower fixed-width/signed/shape signals, registers, ports, buses, memories and finite state/control under declared clock/reset/layout 