mergency authorization where applicable; GOV7 experiment closure when relevant; GOV3/STD20 library owner supplies export stability, compatibility reports and signed provenance; affected compiler/docs/package/migration/test/release owners produce actual consumer conformance and retained tests. The accountable lifecycle record does not substitute for their implementations.\n\nExact source criteria: facet/bootstrap-governance/d0e05b1ed2644e1fd2ce4b85, facet/bootstrap-governance/489b4263da8d23ddabd9e3ae, facet/bootstrap-governance/df842eeb4177a968623ac0a8, facet/bootstrap-governance/37be7f5bd2b4ae59e497d1dc, facet/bootstrap-governance/db8be9ed3c06f63372ff70b4, facet/bootstrap-governance/78c3423f45c1be476ad57dd9, facet/bootstrap-governance/2e9f5cf7506d3736da73112e, facet/bootstrap-governance/9cd815d35a827190fb4ea9c6, facet/bootstrap-governance/d2c7dd8882323ca560e37a99, facet/bootstrap-governance/d634d2f511cc86d514a6d273, facet/bootstrap-governance/07242484e572c5187957998e, facet/bootstrap-governance/a14a05f8a4b60af84326df49, facet/bootstrap-governance/ab2f0f63f41575436939bcdb, facet/bootstrap-governance/e77be9411c2e3a5ce64a216a, facet/bootstrap-governance/ae1a409d8759166b0124487b, facet/bootstrap-governance/6cf3e5c475d03002a6a0f926, facet/bootstrap-governance/71851eebba2ef5d5f0332d7d, facet/bootstrap-governance/9c7ba3bc06e4bbd463c47194, facet/bootstrap-governance/3f3bf717df0f53d9b7fa4cf7, facet/bootstrap-governance/214aa4b6095b637daf154a40, facet/bootstrap-governance/849233a58c888af074151884, facet/bootstrap-governance/48ce65ab7cf428db0d10af20, facet/bootstrap-governance/b7c9748e4bb4a4bae11ce067, facet/bootstrap-governance/9d26093d9d0953d512e6227f.",
